[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14580.71, "timestamp": "04:03:00", "text": "真的有人像你看到的那样尖叫"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14583.99, "timestamp": "04:03:03", "text": "就像番茄酱一样，对吧？等待，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14586.51, "timestamp": "04:03:06", "text": "最后一张地图，那一张"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14589.67, "timestamp": "04:03:09", "text": "我们上次玩过，对吧？那"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14592.389, "timestamp": "04:03:12", "text": "这么多番茄酱，对吧？番茄"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14594.87, "timestamp": "04:03:14", "text": "酱料间。我们真的听到了一声尖叫。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14597.51, "timestamp": "04:03:17", "text": "这就是为什么你喜欢他，就像他倒吸了一口气一样，或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14598.87, "timestamp": "04:03:18", "text": "某物。我不知道。我忘了。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14601.91, "timestamp": "04:03:21", "text": "是的，你采取了行动。但是它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14605.03, "timestamp": "04:03:25", "text": "没有特别针对我们，对吧？哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14607.59, "timestamp": "04:03:27", "text": "等待。没关系。呃，哦，从来没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14608.95, "timestamp": "04:03:28", "text": "头脑。没关系。好的。知道了。知道了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14616.55, "timestamp": "04:03:36", "text": "指纹。我太不擅长寻找东西了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14618.15, "timestamp": "04:03:38", "text": "指纹。我需要像火车一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14620.79, "timestamp": "04:03:40", "text": "我更喜欢寻找指纹。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14623.67, "timestamp": "04:03:43", "text": "知道他们通常在哪儿工作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14625.429, "timestamp": "04:03:45", "text": "他们通常会在门口或者像在……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14628.309, "timestamp": "04:03:48", "text": "窗户，但是非常困难。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14630.229, "timestamp": "04:03:50", "text": "好的，Jin。我们将要讨论……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14632.63, "timestamp": "04:03:52", "text": "金。如今，金已成为一个占有欲极强的幽灵。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14634.79, "timestamp": "04:03:54", "text": "那将发起攻击"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14637.11, "timestamp": "04:03:57", "text": "受到威胁时会发起攻击。它还是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14639.429, "timestamp": "04:03:59", "text": "已知会建造用于旅行的重大"}]